The MiniMax-H3 model code is provided by musubi-tuner (https://github.com/kohya-ss/musubi-tuner, Apache-2.0), which h3rl
installs as a pinned dependency. Model weights and reward models are not included; scripts/download_weights.py fetches them
from their original sources, each under its own license.

Methods implemented: DiffusionNFT (Zheng et al., 2025), Flow-GRPO (Liu et al., 2025), SAGE-GRPO (arXiv 2603.21872).
Reward models used through workers: VideoAlign/VideoReward, HPSv3++, SoliReward, UnifiedReward.
